includes, like, the Pentagon

00:00:41.655 --> 00:00:46.080
and the Navy and DARPA, and Chuck!

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.670
- And Chuck Nice.
(Neil laughs)

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:49.930
Somebody will find your
Twitter profile and be like,

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:51.870
how did Chuck hack his Twitter profile

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:53.484
to get in this list?

00:00:53.484 --> 00:00:56.040
- Well, today we're exploring the science

