00:29:26.853 --> 00:29:29.740
- Okay, so it's not just
words, so for example

00:29:29.740 --> 00:29:32.030
the writer has that challenge,
because if you're just

00:29:32.030 --> 00:29:34.560
putting words on a page
it's harder to then

00:29:34.560 --> 00:29:37.910
communicate the tonality
of how that's actually

00:29:37.910 --> 00:29:38.743
being expressed.

00:29:38.743 --> 00:29:42.310
So the good writers somehow get
