00:30:39.600 --> 00:30:41.170
You can't use your voice, I mean,

00:30:41.170 --> 00:30:42.003
you can't do anything.

00:30:42.003 --> 00:30:44.510
So a performer's taking that
signal and they're getting

00:30:44.510 --> 00:30:46.900
just enough of the emotional information,

00:30:46.900 --> 00:30:49.118
encoding it in the voice so that you--

00:30:49.118 --> 00:30:50.065
- [Neil] On purpose in the moment.

00:30:50.065 --> 00:30:50.898
- So that you can understand it, yeah,

00:30:50.898 --> 00:30:52.150
on purpose, in the moment, but they're not

00:30:52.150 --> 00:30:54.310
going too far, so there's this whole thing

00:30:54.310 --> 00:30:56.988
