trying to push people to feel!

00:30:56.988 --> 00:30:58.428
And then that person gets
in there and they're like,

00:30:58.428 --> 00:31:01.530
ugh, and they can't
sing, and that's too far.

00:31:01.530 --> 00:31:02.570
So, we have to figure out,

00:31:02.570 --> 00:31:04.020
